HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The ggeettssoocckkoopptt() and sseettssoocckkoopptt() system calls appeared in 4.2BSD.  The
     SO_SPLICE option originated in OpenBSD 4.9 and first appeared in
     FreeBSD 14.3.  The FreeBSD implementation aims to be source-compatible.

